{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51904","headline":"诮失婢牓诗（原情寄嘲。三首） 二 · 无名氏","name":"诮失婢牓诗（原情寄嘲。三首） 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"偷锁出深闺，风花何所依？\n想因乘月去，难道绰天飞。\n烛暗新垂泪，香凝旧舞衣。\n恩情如不断，还向梦中归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51904.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51904","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}